; generated by desktop-app/office/builder.config.js for AeroGyan for Students (OFFICE_PACK=students) — do not edit
; Start-menu folder + desktop: the pack's home (launcher page) and every app of the pack (--office=<slug>),
; each with its own icon and AppUserModelID. Missing desktop shortcuts are made on updates too.
; Uninstall removes them all.

!macro customInstall
  RMDir /r "$SMPROGRAMS\AeroGyan for Students"
  CreateDirectory "$SMPROGRAMS\AeroGyan for Students"
  ; AeroGyan for Students: the pack's home (all apps as tiles)
